@startuml
title ATM Control - PIN Validation and Transaction Processing

[*] --> InitialState : System Greeting

state InitialState
state WaitingForPIN
state ValidatingPIN
state DisplayingOptions
state ProcessingRequest
state PrintingReceipt
state DispensingCash
state EjectingCard
state Card confiscated

InitialState --> WaitingForPIN : Card Inserted / Get PIN

WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered / Validate PIN
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForPIN : Invalid PIN / Invalid PIN Prompt
ValidatingPIN --> DisplayingOptions : Valid PIN / Display Menu

DisplayingOptions --> ProcessingRequest : Option Selected /\nProcess Request

ProcessingRequest --> PrintingReceipt : Approved / Print Receipt
ProcessingRequest --> DispensingCash : Approved / Dispense Cash
ProcessingRequest --> EjectingCard : Rejected / Eject

EjectingCard --> Idle : Card Ejected / Display Ejected

note right of ValidatingPIN
The system validates the PIN and either proceeds to display options or prompts again for incorrect entries.
end note

note right of ProcessingRequest
Handles the selected transaction type (withdrawal, transfer, query) and processes accordingly.
end note

@enduml
